293
00:55:13,656 --> 00:55:14,724
Mina?

294
00:55:18,895 --> 00:55:20,763
Mina?

295
00:55:24,201 --> 00:55:26,436
Mina?!

296
00:55:31,809 --> 00:55:33,644
<i>Estava vindo
dali.</i>

297
00:55:42,820 --> 00:55:44,488
Alex?

298
00:55:46,657 --> 00:55:48,626
Alex Whitman?

299
00:55:49,526 --> 00:55:52,130
Hey, uh,
está tudo bem, filho.

300
00:55:53,164 --> 00:55:55,499
