George, vamos pegá-la.

336
00:57:57,592 --> 00:57:59,127
Oh, merda.

337
00:58:00,595 --> 00:58:01,896
<i>Socorro!</i>

338
00:58:03,598 --> 00:58:04,830
<i>Alguém!</i>

339
00:58:04,832 --> 00:58:06,233
Por favor!

340
00:58:06,235 --> 00:58:08,103
