5-5-5...

350
01:00:14,232 --> 01:00:16,668
7-4-5...

351
01:00:23,909 --> 01:00:28,680
5-6-8-7.

352
01:00:50,770 --> 01:00:52,104
<i>Alô?</i>

353
01:00:57,211 --> 01:00:58,911
<i>Alô?</i>

354
01:01:02,249 --> 01:01:04,017
<i>Alô?</i>

355
01:01:05,785 --> 01:01:07,321
Desligue.

356
