437
01:19:08,166 --> 01:19:10,199
Oh, minha garotinha...

438
01:19:44,036 --> 01:19:45,472
Mina?

439
01:20:16,169 --> 01:20:17,638
Mina?

440
01:20:42,029 --> 01:20:43,899
